":["This ticket merges before plump-smelly-indianabat. The Windows sweep on main still fails for the other reason, so AC2 cannot close even though this fix is correct."],"severity":null,"suggested_fix":"","tier":"LLM","validity":1.0,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"yes","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"yes","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"yes","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"yes","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"yes","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"yes","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"yes","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"yes"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"low","divergent_implementation":"incomplete_enumeration","dod_uncertifiable":"underspecified_certification","internal_conflict":"none","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"high","prod_impact":"none","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_revealing":"self_revealing","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"none"}}},{"block_threshold":0.7,"blocking_enabled":true,"checklist_item":"- [ ] Say in Scope/AC that the spawn-ceiling tests run on main's Windows sweep only after plump-smelly-indianabat lands (it deletes `openssh-key-acl.args` and adds the keyprov ACL fix). Either add that ordering/dependency, or change AC2 to name the diag-branch run (e.g. 44591481319) as pre-merge evidence and make the on-main check depend on indianabat.","cohort":["G1G2"],"criteria":["G1G2"],"decision":"advisory","decision_margin":-0.15,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":[".github/windows-sweep-deselect/openssh-key-acl.args:12: --deselect=tests/unit/test_opcert_service.py::test_completion_fail_spawn_ceiling",".github/windows-sweep-deselect/openssh-key-acl.args:16: --deselect=tests/unit/test_opcert_service.py::test_completion_pass_spawn_ceiling","Plan Scope lists only `src/rebar/_store/project_ensures.py` and the new test file","plump-smelly-indianabat (977f-11fe-1dcb-4b7d) Scope: `.github/windows-sweep-deselect/openssh-key-acl.args` — deleted; its comment: 'Ordering: wasp and mink land on main BEFORE this change ... AC2 is checked on main after all 3 land.'","Plan Observation: the failures were seen only on the diag branch 'the plump-smelly-indianabat fix applied'"],"finding":"AC2 needs edits outside this plan's Scope that the plan never names. Both spawn-ceiling tests are deselected from the Windows sweep by `.github/windows-sweep-deselect/openssh-key-acl.args`. They can only pass on Windows once plump-smelly-indianabat's keyprov ACL fix is on main, and that same ticket deletes the argfile. The plan neither lists the argfile in Scope nor declares a dependency on or ordering with indianabat. Indianabat's own comment says this ticket (wasp) lands BEFORE it. So right after this change merges, a `sweep (windows)` run on main will not run the two tests at all.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f39f671c794e2befd","impact":0.55,"is_primary":null,"location":"Acceptance Criteria (2nd bullet) / Scope / Testing 'After merge'","norm_id":"nfe65c0b7dc059ada","priority":0.55,"reason":"default-advisory","recalled":false,"scenarios":["This change merges first, as indianabat's ordering requires. The next main `sweep (windows)` deselects both tests, so AC2 cannot be shown, and the ticket either stalls or is closed against a run that never ran the tests.","Someone tries to meet AC2 inside this ticket by removing only the two deselect lines. The tests then fail on main with the compose_signer OWNER RIGHTS error, because the keyprov fix has not landed."],"severity":null,"suggested_fix":"Add a Scope/Testing note: \"The two spawn-ceiling tests stay deselected on Windows via `.github/windows-sweep-deselect/openssh-key-acl.args` until plump-smelly-indianabat deletes it. Pre-merge evidence is diag run 44591481319 on